    <description>Provides Base64Url encoding, decoding and validation APIs support for .NET Framework and .NET Standard.
      Provides Index and Range types support for .NET Framework and .NET Standard 2.0.

      Commonly Used Types:
      System.Buffers.Text.Base64Url
      System.Index
      System.Range</description>
